# ======= ÉTAPE 3: Tester la planification de trajet =======

### planifier un trajet

POST http://rofieda.lvh.me:8000/api/captures/planifier-trajet/ HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nom_trajet": "Trj_machine_RF007_aller",
  "objet_tracking_nom": "machine_RF007",
  "source_nom": "Alger",
  "date_prevu_source": "2025-08-28",
  "destination_nom": "Tlemcen",
  "date_prevu_destination": "2025-09-05",
  "points": [
    {
      "nom_lieu": "ORAN",
      "ordre": 1,
      "date_prevu": "2025-08-30"
    },
    {
      "nom_lieu": "Mostaganem",
      "ordre": 2,
      "date_prevu": "2025-09-01"
    }
  ]
}

